WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Enjoy your advantage. It will not last.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:16.000
You all will be transmuted. Soon...

3
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Well, that's it... There is no way back.

4
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Great job. Now we know that the Architects are definitely mortal.

5
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:36.000
What a weird place... Can you feel it?

6
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Some kind of energy... or pulsation... I don't get it, but we have no choice. Let's go!
